                  Election},
  author       = {Nizzoli, L and Tardelli, S and Avvenuti, M and Cresci, S and
                  Tesconi, M},
  journaltitle = {ArXiv},
  date         = {2020},
  abstract     = {Coordinated online behaviors are an important part of
                  information and influence operations, as they allow a more
                  effective disinformation's spread. Most studies on coordinated
                  behaviors involved manual investigations and the few existing
                  computational approaches make bold assumptions or oversimplify
                  the problem to make it tractable. Here, we propose a new
